# Why: tests, snapshots, the plugin bundle and the launcher's sh script are compared byte for byte, so every text file is checked out
# with LF on every platform (a Windows runner's default autocrlf would hand them CRLF and fail the golden and contract tiers).
* text=auto eol=lf
# the one exception: the Windows launcher entry is a cmd batch file. cmd's label search (goto/call :label) is unreliable on LF-only files, so it is checked out with CRLF everywhere.
launcher/mm3-launch.cmd text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.woff2 binary
